@startuml get-manager-company
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
hide footbox

title GET /api/manager/v1/company
caption CRB-68 · 회사(alias) 목록. 검토가 필요한 회사(needs_review)가 맨 위

actor Client
participant "ManagerGuard" as Guard
participant "ValidationPipe" as Pipe
participant "AdminCompanyController" as Controller
participant "AdminCompanyService" as Service
participant "AdminCompanyRepository" as AdminCompanyRepository
participant "FileService" as FileService
database PostgreSQL

Client -> Guard: GET /api/manager/v1/company?q=&page=&size=\nAuthorization: Bearer <manager token>
ref over Client, Guard: ManagerGuard — flow/manager-guards.puml\n401 Missing access token / Token expired / Invalid token / Manager not found
Guard -> Pipe: 통과
alt query 검증 실패 (q 128자 초과, page < 1, size < 1 또는 > 100)
  Pipe -[#red]-> Client: 400 (class-validator 메시지)
end
note right of Pipe: 기본값 page = 1, size = 20. q 없으면 전체 (병합 대상 고르기에서 씀)
Pipe -> Controller: list(query)
Controller -> Service: list(query)

par 동시에 조회 — 같은 조건
  Service -> AdminCompanyRepository: findPage({ q, offset, limit })
  AdminCompanyRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT ca.*, names(json_agg: pk, name),\n(SELECT count(*) FROM graduated_profile WHERE company_alias_pk = ca.pk) AS graduated_count\nFROM company_alias ca\nWHERE (q 가 있으면 EXISTS company_name LIKE '%q%')\nORDER BY ca.needs_review DESC, ca.created_at DESC, ca.pk DESC\nLIMIT size OFFSET offset
  note right
    q 검색은 사용자 검색과 같은 정규화 · company_name 기준.
    graduated_count: 탈퇴 유예 등 상태와 관계없이 이 회사를 가리키는 프로필 수
    (병합 · 삭제 판단용)
  end note
  AdminCompanyRepository --> Service: rows
else
  Service -> AdminCompanyRepository: (count)
  AdminCompanyRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT count(*) (같은 WHERE)
  AdminCompanyRepository --> Service: total
end

Service -> FileService: getPresignedUrls(logo_keys)
note right: key마다 한 번, 서버에서 서명만 계산 (S3 호출 없음)
note right of Service: 트랜잭션 없음 (조회만)

Service --> Controller: { items, page, size, total }
Controller --> Client: 200 { items: [{ company_id, name, logo_url | null, needs_review,\nnames: [{ name_id, name }], graduated_count, created_at }], page, size, total }

@enduml
